}}
```

=== 5.2 Outdated Content

'''Migration Strategy:'''
* Mark as Historical
* Add update date
* Link to current version
* Note changes

'''Template:'''
```mediawiki
{{Historical_Content
|as_of=2025-01-01
|current_version=Link to updated content
|changes=Summary of changes
}}
```

=== 5.3 Non-English Sources

'''Migration Strategy:'''
